# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look glass
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=[];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot cc-open
note Sound capsule: row 4, x 1560..1880, y 380..452
setup wpctl set-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@ 0.5
wait 1
ptr move 1640 416 sleep 100 click
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note wpctl ~0.25; the white fill reaches 25% within one frame
shot click-25
rec drag-20-80 2 ptr move 1624 416 sleep 50 down sleep 50 glide 1816 416 600 sleep 50 up
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note wpctl ~0.80; in the recording the fill never moves back while the pointer moves right
ptr move 1720 416 sleep 100 scroll 0 -15 sleep 100 scroll 0 -15 sleep 100 scroll 0 -15
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note +15% after three notches up
ptr move 1720 416 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 1
shot hold-page
note level back to before the press; the Sound page popover opens beside the panel
key -k Escape
wait 1
ptr move 1720 416 sleep 50 click
key -k Tab
key -k Right -k Right -k Right -k Right -k Right
wait 1
setup wpctl get-volume @DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@
note the five Right presses add +25% (not +5%) — focus may need extra Tabs to reach Sound; shot to check the ring
shot keys
ptr move 1720 333 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot display-click
note Display fill jumps to ~50%
setup sh -c 'while :; do pw-play --volume 0.05 /usr/share/sounds/freedesktop/stereo/complete.oga; done' >/dev/null 2>&1 &
wait 2
ptr move 1720 416 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 1
shot sound-page
note on the Sound page find the app's slider (Applications) and the Microphone slider in the shot; drag each 10%->90%: the drag holds to the end
static sound-page 1182 50 352 600
ipc panels close
